msgid ""
"  codecs web   Web video in Firefox only. Replaces Fedora's empty OpenH264 stand-in with\n"
"               Cisco's OpenH264 from Fedora's Cisco repository, under Cisco's own H.264\n"
"               patent license.\n"
"  codecs full  Everything. Replaces Fedora's free ffmpeg libraries with the full ffmpeg,\n"
"               x264 and x265 from RPM Fusion, the source standard Fedora uses."
msgstr ""
"  codecs web   Físeán gréasáin i Firefox amháin. Cuireann sé OpenH264 Cisco ó stór Cisco Fedora\n"
"               in ionad an ionadaí fholaimh OpenH264 atá ag Fedora, faoi cheadúnas paitinne\n"
"               H.264 Cisco féin.\n"
"  codecs full  Gach rud. Cuireann sé an ffmpeg iomlán, x264 agus x265 ó RPM Fusion, an fhoinse\n"
"               a úsáideann gnáth-Fedora, in ionad leabharlanna saora ffmpeg Fedora."

msgid ""
"  evenkeel-os-packages install [FILE]   install an .rpm or .deb (no FILE: pick one from Downloads)\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages remove           remove an app installed this way\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages check FILE       say what a package needs, without installing anything\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages repair           set a broken app box up again (--if-broken: only if one does not work)\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages login            choose box apps that start when you log in\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages windows FILE     a Windows .exe or .msi: offer a Linux app that does its job\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages check-windows FILE  say what a Windows file is and what would be offered, without any window\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages zoom LINK        a Zoom \"open the app\" link: open the meeting in Zoom's web version, in Chrome\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages vpn [NAME]       add a VPN from its company's own download source (mullvad, proton, ivpn,\n"
"                                        nordvpn; no NAME: pick one)"
msgstr ""
"  evenkeel-os-packages install [FILE]   suiteáil .rpm nó .deb (gan FILE: roghnaigh ceann as Íoslódálacha)\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages remove           bain aip a suiteáladh ar an mbealach seo\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages check FILE       abair cad a theastaíonn ó phacáiste, gan aon rud a shuiteáil\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages repair           socraigh bosca aipeanna briste arís (--if-broken: ach amháin mura n-oibríonn ceann)\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages login            roghnaigh aipeanna bosca a thosaíonn nuair a logálann tú isteach\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages windows FILE     .exe nó .msi Windows: tairg aip Linux a dhéanann an obair chéanna\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages check-windows FILE  abair cén cineál comhaid Windows é agus cad a thairgfí, gan aon fhuinneog\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages zoom LINK        nasc Zoom \"oscail an aip\": oscail an cruinniú i leagan gréasáin Zoom, i gChrome\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages vpn [NAME]       cuir VPN leis ó fhoinse íoslódála na cuideachta féin (mullvad, proton, ivpn,\n"
"                                        nordvpn; gan NAME: roghnaigh ceann)"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\"{name}\" comes with Fedora. The trusted list is rebuilt from Fedora's "
"current list at every start, so an update replaces or drops it; keep "
"automatic updates on. If this alert stays after updating and restarting, tell"
" your helper."
msgstr ""
"Tagann \"{name}\" le Fedora. Atógtar an liosta iontaofa ó liosta reatha "
"Fedora ag gach tosú, mar sin cuirfidh nuashonrú ceann eile ina áit nó "
"bainfidh sé é; coinnigh na nuashonruithe uathoibríocha casta air. Má fhanann "
"an foláireamh seo tar éis duit nuashonrú agus atosú, inis do do chúntóir."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\"{name}\" has expired, but its file ({file}) holds {n} certificate, and "
"removing it would remove them all, the good ones too. Tell your helper."
msgid_plural ""
"\"{name}\" has expired, but its file ({file}) holds {n} certificates, and "
"removing it would remove them all, the good ones too. Tell your helper."
msgstr[0] ""
"Tá \"{name}\" imithe in éag, ach tá {n} deimhniú ina chomhad ({file}), agus "
"dá mbainfí é, bhainfí iad go léir, na cinn mhaithe freisin. Inis do do "
"chúntóir."
msgstr[1] ""
"Tá \"{name}\" imithe in éag, ach tá {n} dheimhniú ina chomhad ({file}), agus "
"dá mbainfí é, bhainfí iad go léir, na cinn mhaithe freisin. Inis do do "
"chúntóir."
msgstr[2] ""
"Tá \"{name}\" imithe in éag, ach tá {n} dheimhniú ina chomhad ({file}), agus "
"dá mbainfí é, bhainfí iad go léir, na cinn mhaithe freisin. Inis do do "
"chúntóir."
msgstr[3] ""
"Tá \"{name}\" imithe in éag, ach tá {n} ndeimhniú ina chomhad ({file}), agus "
"dá mbainfí é, bhainfí iad go léir, na cinn mhaithe freisin. Inis do do "
"chúntóir."
msgstr[4] ""
"Tá \"{name}\" imithe in éag, ach tá {n} deimhniú ina chomhad ({file}), agus "
"dá mbainfí é, bhainfí iad go léir, na cinn mhaithe freisin. Inis do do "
"chúntóir."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\"{name}\" has expired. It was added in a way Wheelhouse can't remove; tell "
"your helper."
msgstr ""
"Tá \"{name}\" imithe in éag. Cuireadh leis é ar bhealach nach féidir le "
"Wheelhouse a bhaint; inis do do chúntóir."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "\"{name}\" is removed and no longer trusted."
msgstr "Baineadh \"{name}\" agus níl muinín as a thuilleadh."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\"{name}\" was added to this computer and expired on {date}. An expired "
"certificate shouldn't be relied on. Remove it if you no longer need it; if "
"you do, ask whoever gave it to you for a new one. Removing it needs your "
"password."
msgstr ""
"Cuireadh \"{name}\" leis an ríomhaire seo agus chuaigh sé in éag ar an "
"{date}. Níor cheart brath ar dheimhniú atá imithe in éag. Bain é mura bhfuil "
"gá agat leis a thuilleadh; má tá gá agat leis, iarr ceann nua ar an duine a "
"thug é duit. Teastaíonn d'fhocal faire chun é a bhaint."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\"{name}\" was added to this computer and expires on {date}. Ask whoever gave"
" it to you for a new one before then."
msgstr ""
"Cuireadh \"{name}\" leis an ríomhaire seo agus rachaidh sé in éag ar an "
"{date}. Iarr ceann nua ar an duine a thug é duit roimh an dáta sin."

msgid "(nothing was printed)"
msgstr "(ní raibh aon aschur)"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "- and {n} more"
msgid_plural "- and {n} more"
msgstr[0] "- agus {n} eile"
msgstr[1] "- agus {n} eile"
msgstr[2] "- agus {n} eile"
msgstr[3] "- agus {n} eile"
msgstr[4] "- agus {n} eile"

msgid ""
"1.00 is the normal size. Large text in Settings, Accessibility sets 1.25."
msgstr ""
"Is é 1.00 an gnáthmhéid. Socraíonn Téacs Mór (Large Text) i Socruithe, "
"Accessibility 1.25."

msgid "12 hour"
msgstr "12 uair an chloig"

msgid "24 hour"
msgstr "24 uair an chloig"

msgid ""
"A .deb driver can't be installed. The window says how to get the .rpm from "
"the maker."
msgstr ""
"Ní féidir tiománaí .deb a shuiteáil. Insíonn an fhuinneog conas an .rpm a "
"fháil ón déantóir."

msgid "A USB mouse works."
msgstr "Oibríonn luch USB."

msgid "A USB webcam works."
msgstr "Oibríonn ceamara gréasáin USB."

msgid "A VPN"
msgstr "VPN"

msgid "A Windows program you downloaded (.exe or .msi)"
msgstr "Clár Windows a d’íoslódáil tú (.exe nó .msi)"

msgid "A background service fails"
msgstr "Teipeann ar sheirbhís chúlra"

msgid ""
"A background service that runs on this computer fails to start (the mobile "
"broadband service, or the graphics switching service)."
msgstr ""
"Teipeann ar sheirbhís chúlra a ritheann ar an ríomhaire seo tosú (an "
"tseirbhís leathanbhanda soghluaiste, nó an tseirbhís a athraíonn idir "
"grafaicí)."

msgid "A bottom bar, with a start menu on the logo"
msgstr "Barra ag bun an scáileáin, le roghchlár tosaigh ar an lógó"

msgid "A broken app box"
msgstr "Bosca aipeanna briste"

msgid "A built-in camera of the newer laptop kind was found."
msgstr ""
"Fuarthas ceamara ionsuite den chineál atá ar ríomhairí glúine níos nuaí."

msgid "A café, hotel, airport, or anywhere else. Nothing gets in."
msgstr ""
"Caifé, óstán, aerfort, nó áit ar bith eile. Ní thagann aon rud isteach."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "A certificate needs attention"
msgid_plural "{n} certificates need attention"
msgstr[0] "Tá aird de dhíth ar {n} deimhniú"
msgstr[1] "Tá aird de dhíth ar {n} dheimhniú"
msgstr[2] "Tá aird de dhíth ar {n} dheimhniú"
msgstr[3] "Tá aird de dhíth ar {n} ndeimhniú"
msgstr[4] "Tá aird de dhíth ar {n} deimhniú"

msgid ""
"A change to the boot options is waiting. It starts at your next restart. It isn't an update.\n"
"\n"
"If you don't want it: Don't use it. The computer starts with the boot options it has now, and automatic updates aren't paused.\n"
"\n"
"Or Keep it."
msgstr ""
"Tá athrú ar na roghanna tosaithe ag feitheamh. Tiocfaidh sé i bhfeidhm ag an gcéad atosú eile. Ní nuashonrú é.\n"
"\n"
"Mura dteastaíonn sé uait: Ná húsáid é. Tosaíonn an ríomhaire leis na roghanna tosaithe atá aige anois, agus ní chuirtear na nuashonruithe uathoibríocha ar sos.\n"
"\n"
"Nó Coinnigh é."

msgid "A device"
msgstr "Gléas"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "A device lost its driver ({driver})"
msgstr "Chaill gléas a thiománaí ({driver})"

msgid "A disk is hidden."
msgstr "Tá diosca i bhfolach."

msgid "A driver file from the maker"
msgstr "Comhad tiománaí ón déantóir"

msgid "A file of recent errors to email to your helper"
msgstr ""
"Comhad ina bhfuil earráidí a tharla le déanaí le seoladh ar ríomhphost chuig "
"do chúntóir"

msgid "A full name can't have : or , in it."
msgstr "Ní féidir : nó , a bheith in ainm iomlán."

msgid "A graphics chip has no driver."
msgstr "Níl tiománaí ag slis ghrafaicí."

msgid ""
"A network is only needed for automatic time and time zone. To use Wi-Fi, "
"click a network. Or click Next to go on without it."
msgstr ""
"Ní theastaíonn líonra ach amháin don am agus don chrios ama uathoibríoch. "
"Chun Wi-Fi a úsáid, cliceáil ar líonra. Nó cliceáil Ar Aghaidh chun leanúint "
"ar aghaidh gan é."

msgid ""
"A new layout shows after you log out and back in. It changes only your own "
"desktop."
msgstr ""
"Taispeánfar leagan amach nua tar éis duit logáil amach agus logáil isteach "
"arís. Ní athraíonn sé ach do dheasc féin."

msgid "A new system is ready."
msgstr "Tá córas nua réidh."

msgid "A new system is ready. Restart to use it."
msgstr "Tá córas nua réidh. Atosaigh chun é a úsáid."

msgid ""
"A new system version is used from the next restart. Keep working, and restart"
" when it suits you."
msgstr ""
"Úsáidfear leagan nua den chóras ón gcéad atosú eile. Lean ort ag obair, agus "
"atosaigh nuair a oireann sé duit."

msgid ""
"A new version also goes back if something that worked before is broken after "
"you log in, like sound, Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, the camera or printing. Unplugged "
"or switched-off things don't count."
msgstr ""
"Téann an córas siar ó leagan nua freisin má bhíonn rud éigin a d'oibrigh "
"roimhe briste tar éis duit logáil isteach, mar shampla an fhuaim, Wi-Fi, "
"Bluetooth, an ceamara nó an phriontáil. Ní áirítear rudaí atá díphlugáilte nó"
" múchta."

msgid "A new version is ready"
msgstr "Tá leagan nua réidh"

msgid ""
"A note at the next login says so and names what broke, and automatic updates "
"pause for 3 days."
msgstr ""
"Luann nóta ag an gcéad logáil isteach eile é sin agus ainmníonn sé cad a "
"bhris, agus cuirtear na nuashonruithe uathoibríocha ar sos ar feadh 3 lá."

msgid ""
"A rollback test copy is running. Restart first, so the computer goes back to "
"the usual version."
msgstr ""
"Tá cóip thástála um rolladh siar ag rith. Atosaigh ar dtús, ionas go rachaidh"
" an ríomhaire ar ais go dtí an gnáthleagan."

msgid "A security certificate expired, expires within 30 days, or was removed."
msgstr ""
"Tá deimhniú slándála imithe in éag, rachaidh sé in éag laistigh de 30 lá, nó "
"baineadh é."

msgid "A slideshow of your own pictures"
msgstr "Taispeántas sleamhnán de do chuid grianghraf féin"

msgid "A sound chip was found, but it didn't start."
msgstr "Fuarthas slis fuaime, ach níor thosaigh sí."

msgid "A start-up check fails"
msgstr "Teipeann ar sheiceáil tosaithe"

msgid ""
"A start-up check fails on purpose. The computer restarts by itself within "
"seconds, twice, and the third start is back on this version."
msgstr ""
"Teipeann ar sheiceáil tosaithe d'aon ghnó. Atosaíonn an ríomhaire as féin "
"laistigh de chúpla soicind, faoi dhó, agus ar an tríú tosú bíonn sé ar ais ar"
" an leagan seo."

msgid "A system service fails"
msgstr "Teipeann ar sheirbhís chórais"

msgid "A system update is also waiting for a restart."
msgstr "Tá nuashonrú córais ag fanacht le hatosú freisin."

msgid "A tool"
msgstr "Uirlis"

msgid "A top bar, with the logo menu at the top left"
msgstr "Barra uachtarach, leis an roghchlár lógó ar an taobh clé uachtarach"

msgid ""
"A user name uses small letters, digits, - and _, and starts with a letter."
msgstr ""
"Úsáideann ainm úsáideora litreacha beaga, digití, - agus _, agus tosaíonn sé "
"le litir."

msgid ""
"A wired network is set to Home, so this happens on any cable you plug in."
msgstr ""
"Tá líonra sreangaithe socraithe mar Baile, mar sin tarlaíonn sé seo ar aon "
"chábla a phlugálann tú isteach."

msgid "A wireless chip was found, but it didn't start."
msgstr "Fuarthas slis gan sreang, ach níor thosaigh sí."

msgid "A wireless chip was found, with no driver for it."
msgstr "Fuarthas slis gan sreang, ach níl aon tiománaí aici."

msgid "AMD: flicker, turn off Panel Replay"
msgstr "AMD: splancarnach, múch Panel Replay"

msgid "AMD: flicker, turn off Panel Self Refresh"
msgstr "AMD: splancarnach, múch Panel Self Refresh"

msgid "AMD: flicker, turn off both"
msgstr "AMD: splancarnach, múch an dá cheann"

msgid "AMD: screen dims or shifts colors on its own"
msgstr "AMD: téann an scáileán dorcha nó athraíonn sé dathanna as féin"

msgid "AMD: white flickering"
msgstr "AMD: splancarnach bhán"

msgid ""
"About 20 seconds after the login screen shows, the computer locks up. Hold "
"the power button until it turns off, then turn it on. After the second "
"freeze, the next start is back on this version."
msgstr ""
"Thart ar 20 soicind tar éis don scáileán logála isteach teacht ar an "
"scáileán, reonn an ríomhaire. Coinnigh an cnaipe cumhachta brúite go dtí go "
"múchann sé, ansin cas air é. Tar éis an dara reo, beidh an chéad tosú eile ar"
" ais ar an leagan seo."

msgid "About it"
msgstr "Eolas faoi seo"

msgid "About this driver"
msgstr "Eolas faoin tiománaí seo"

msgid "Accent color and wallpaper"
msgstr "Dath béime agus cúlbhrat"

msgid "Account"
msgstr "Cuntas"

msgid "Add"
msgstr "Cuir leis"

msgid "Add a folder"
msgstr "Cuir fillteán leis"

msgid "Add a folder and set the sharing password below."
msgstr "Cuir fillteán leis agus socraigh an focal faire comhroinnte thíos."

msgid "Add a folder from your home folder."
msgstr "Cuir fillteán leis ó d'fhillteán baile."

msgid "Add a printer"
msgstr "Cuir printéir leis"

msgid "Add a setting, like amdgpu.abmlevel=0"
msgstr "Cuir socrú leis, amhail amdgpu.abmlevel=0"

msgid "Add anyway"
msgstr "Cuir leis ar aon chuma"

msgid "Add it"
msgstr "Cuir leis é"

msgid ""
"Add it only if you know you need it. If the computer then won't start, "
"automatic rollback goes back to the version before."
msgstr ""
"Ná cuir leis é ach amháin má tá a fhios agat go bhfuil sé de dhíth ort. Mura "
"dtosóidh an ríomhaire ansin, téann an rolladh siar uathoibríoch ar ais go dtí"
" an leagan roimhe sin."

msgid "Add or remove an app's hardware rules"
msgstr "Cuir rialacha crua-earraí aipe leis nó bain iad"

msgid "Add or remove media codecs"
msgstr "Cuir codecanna meán leis nó bain iad"

msgid "Add the media codecs"
msgstr "Cuir na codecanna meán leis"

msgid "Add to the system"
msgstr "Cuir leis an gcóras"

msgid "Add video and audio codecs"
msgstr "Cuir codecanna físe agus fuaime leis"

msgid "Add, turn on or remove a VPN or an app's background service"
msgstr "Cuir VPN nó seirbhís chúlra aipe leis, cas air é nó bain é"

msgid "Added by you"
msgstr "Curtha leis agat féin"

msgid "Added to this computer"
msgstr "Curtha leis an ríomhaire seo"

msgid "Adding a printer, and printer driver files from the maker"
msgstr "Printéir agus comhaid tiománaí printéara ón déantóir a chur leis"

msgid ""
"Adding the desktop parts apps expect (progress windows and notifications)"
msgstr ""
"Na codanna deisce a mbíonn aipeanna ag súil leo a chur leis (fuinneoga dul "
"chun cinn agus fógraí)"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Adding the download source {name}"
msgstr "An fhoinse íoslódála {name} á cur leis"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Adding {title} to the system"
msgstr "{title} á chur leis an gcóras"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Adding {title} to the system from Fedora. A progress window shows it."
msgstr ""
"{title} á chur leis an gcóras ó Fedora. Taispeánann fuinneog dul chun cinn é."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Adding {title} to the system from Fedora. This can take a few minutes."
msgstr ""
"{title} á chur leis an gcóras ó Fedora. D'fhéadfadh sé seo cúpla nóiméad a "
"thógáil."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Adding {title} to the system. A progress window shows it."
msgstr "{title} á chur leis an gcóras. Taispeánann fuinneog dul chun cinn é."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Adding {title} to the system. This can take a few minutes."
msgstr ""
"{title} á chur leis an gcóras. D’fhéadfadh sé seo cúpla nóiméad a thógáil."

msgid "Administrator"
msgstr "Riarthóir"

msgid "Administrator account (root)"
msgstr "Cuntas riarthóra (root)"

msgid "Administrator: no."
msgstr "Riarthóir: níl."

msgid "Administrator: yes."
msgstr "Riarthóir: tá."

msgid ""
"After a BIOS update, it may ask for the disk password again. Turn it on again"
" here."
msgstr ""
"Tar éis nuashonrú BIOS, d’fhéadfadh sé focal faire an diosca a iarraidh arís."
" Cas air arís anseo."

msgid ""
"After an undo, so the same update doesn't come straight back. They turn back "
"on by themselves."
msgstr ""
"Tar éis cealú, ionas nach dtiocfaidh an nuashonrú céanna ar ais díreach ina "
"dhiaidh sin. Casann siad air arís iad féin."

msgid "After the restart, you will be asked to add your printer."
msgstr "Tar éis an atosaithe, iarrfar ort do phrintéir a chur leis."

msgid ""
"After the restart, you'll be asked for your password once, to turn it on."
msgstr ""
"Tar éis an atosaithe, iarrfar d'fhocal faire ort uair amháin, chun é a "
"chasadh air."

msgid "After the restart, you'll get a message when it's ready."
msgstr ""
"Tar éis an atosaithe, gheobhaidh tú teachtaireacht nuair a bheidh sé réidh."

msgid "Alpha"
msgstr "Alfa"

msgid "Also let in, on Home"
msgstr "Lig isteach freisin, ar líonra Baile"

msgid ""
"Alt+Tab switches between apps. Alt and the key above Tab switches between "
"windows of the same app."
msgstr ""
"Athraíonn Alt+Tab idir aipeanna. Athraíonn Alt agus an eochair os cionn Tab "
"idir fuinneoga den aip chéanna."

msgid ""
"An .rpm or .deb installs the app. An .exe or .msi gets its Linux version."
msgstr ""
"Suiteálann comhad .rpm nó .deb an aip. Faigheann comhad .exe nó .msi a leagan"
" Linux."

msgid "An app that comes as a .rpm or .deb file"
msgstr "Aip a thagann mar chomhad .rpm nó .deb"

msgid "An office. Nothing gets in, and your folders aren't shared."
msgstr ""
"Oifig. Ní thagann aon rud isteach, agus ní roinntear do chuid fillteán."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"An update from {staged} is waiting. It starts at your next restart. The version you're using now is from {booted}.\n"
"\n"
"If you don't want it: Don't use it. Your computer keeps the version it has now. A boot options change made since the update came is dropped with it."
msgstr ""
"Tá nuashonrú ó {staged} ag fanacht. Tiocfaidh sé i bhfeidhm ag an gcéad atosú eile. Is ó {booted} an leagan atá á úsáid agat anois.\n"
"\n"
"Mura dteastaíonn sé uait: Ná húsáid é. Coinníonn do ríomhaire an leagan atá aige anois. Caithfear amach leis aon athrú ar na roghanna tosaithe a rinneadh ó tháinig an nuashonrú."

msgid "An update is waiting for a restart. Restart first, then run the test."
msgstr ""
"Tá nuashonrú ag fanacht le hatosú. Atosaigh ar dtús, ansin rith an tástáil."

msgid "Another disk is hidden by a BIOS setting."
msgstr "Tá diosca eile i bhfolach mar gheall ar shocrú BIOS."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Another install or removal is running ({doing}). This waits for it to finish,"
" then goes on."
msgstr ""
"Tá suiteáil nó baint eile ar siúl ({doing}). Fanann sé go dtí go mbeidh sé "
"críochnaithe, agus ansin leanann sé ar aghaidh."

msgid ""
"Another version is set to start at your next restart (after Undo the last "
"update, or picking a version in the boot menu), so the test wouldn't test "
"anything. Restart first, then run the test."
msgstr ""
"Tá leagan eile socraithe le tosú ag an gcéad atosú eile (tar éis Cealaigh an "
"nuashonrú deireanach, nó leagan a roghnú sa roghchlár tosaithe), mar sin ní "
"thástálfadh an tástáil aon rud. Atosaigh ar dtús, ansin rith an tástáil."

msgid "App"
msgstr "Aip"

msgid "App, game or port number"
msgstr "Aip, cluiche nó uimhir phoirt"

msgid ""
"Applies them at login: the next slide for \"at each login\", and dark or "
"light for the time of day"
msgstr ""
"Cuireann sé i bhfeidhm iad ag an logáil isteach: an chéad sleamhnán eile le "
"haghaidh \"ag gach logáil isteach\", agus dorcha nó geal de réir an ama den "
"lá"

msgid "Apps"
msgstr "Aipeanna"

msgid "Apps and ports let in"
msgstr "Aipeanna agus poirt a ligtear isteach"

msgid "Apps from Bazaar have this setting inside the app."
msgstr "Tá an socrú seo ag aipeanna ó Bazaar laistigh den aip."

msgid "Apps from Bazaar update on their own. Remove them in Bazaar too."
msgstr ""
"Déanann aipeanna ó Bazaar nuashonrú astu féin. Bain iad i mBazaar freisin."

msgid "Apps from Bazaar: open Bazaar and remove it there."
msgstr "Aipeanna ó Bazaar: oscail Bazaar agus bain ansin é."

msgid ""
"Apps from a file, Get a VPN or a Windows program: Wheelhouse, Apps, Remove "
"apps."
msgstr ""
"Aipeanna ó chomhad, Faigh VPN nó clár Windows: Wheelhouse, Aipeanna, Bain "
"aipeanna."

msgid ""
"Apps from a file: open Wheelhouse, Apps, Start apps at login, and pick the "
"app. Picking it again stops it."
msgstr ""
"Aipeanna ó chomhad: oscail Wheelhouse, Aipeanna, Tosaigh aipeanna ag logáil "
"isteach, agus roghnaigh an aip. Má roghnaíonn tú arís í, ní thosóidh sí a "
"thuilleadh."

msgid "Apps from package files"
msgstr "Aipeanna ó chomhaid phacáiste"

msgid "Apps from their own download sources"
msgstr "Aipeanna óna bhfoinsí íoslódála féin"

msgid "Apps you added from files, Get a VPN or Windows programs"
msgstr "Aipeanna a chuir tú leis ó chomhaid, Faigh VPN nó cláir Windows"

msgid "April"
msgstr "Aibreán"

msgid ""
"ArtCraft's downloads can't be reached right now. Check the internet "
"connection and try again."
msgstr ""
"Ní féidir teacht ar íoslódálacha ArtCraft faoi láthair. Seiceáil an nasc "
"idirlín agus bain triail as arís."

msgid "ArtCraft's signature is checked first, and it updates once a day."
msgstr ""
"Seiceáiltear síniú ArtCraft ar dtús, agus nuashonraítear é uair amháin sa lá."

msgid ""
"Asks once whether a password Wi-Fi or wired network is Home, Work or a Public"
" place"
msgstr ""
"Fiafraíonn sé uair amháin an Baile, Obair nó Áit phoiblí é líonra Wi-Fi le "
"focal faire nó líonra sreangaithe"

msgid "At each login"
msgstr "Ag gach logáil isteach"

msgid "August"
msgstr "Lúnasa"

msgid "Authentication is required to add or remove an app's hardware rules"
msgstr ""
"Teastaíonn fíordheimhniú chun rialacha crua-earraí aipe a chur leis nó a "
"bhaint"

msgid "Authentication is required to add or remove media codecs"
msgstr "Teastaíonn fíordheimhniú chun codecanna meán a chur leis nó a bhaint"

msgid ""
"Authentication is required to add, turn on or remove a VPN or an app's "
"background service"
msgstr ""
"Teastaíonn fíordheimhniú chun VPN nó seirbhís chúlra aipe a chur leis, a "
"chasadh air nó a bhaint"

msgid "Authentication is required to change a Wheelhouse setting"
msgstr "Teastaíonn fíordheimhniú chun socrú Wheelhouse a athrú"

msgid "Authentication is required to change the boot options"
msgstr "Teastaíonn fíordheimhniú chun na roghanna tosaithe a athrú"

msgid ""
"Authentication is required to delete important settings for the repair test"
msgstr ""
"Teastaíonn fíordheimhniú chun socruithe tábhachtacha don tástáil dheisiúcháin"
" a scriosadh"

msgid "Authentication is required to install EvenKeelOS"
msgstr "Teastaíonn fíordheimhniú chun EvenKeelOS a shuiteáil"

msgid "Authentication is required to remove a trusted certificate"
msgstr "Teastaíonn fíordheimhniú chun deimhniú iontaofa a bhaint"

msgid "Automatic"
msgstr "Uathoibríoch"

msgid "Automatic disk unlock"
msgstr "Díghlasáil uathoibríoch diosca"

msgid "Automatic rollback"
msgstr "Rolladh siar uathoibríoch"

msgid "Automatic rollback note"
msgstr "Nóta faoin rolladh siar uathoibríoch"

msgid "Automatic updates"
msgstr "Nuashonruithe uathoibríocha"

msgid "Automatic updates are back on."
msgstr "Tá nuashonruithe uathoibríocha casta air arís."

msgid "Automatic updates are back on. The next daily update runs as normal."
msgstr ""
"Tá nuashonruithe uathoibríocha casta air arís. Rithfidh an chéad nuashonrú "
"laethúil eile mar is gnách."

msgid "Automatic updates are off"
msgstr "Tá nuashonruithe uathoibríocha casta as"

msgid "Automatic updates are off. Run System Update yourself to update."
msgstr ""
"Tá nuashonruithe uathoibríocha casta as. Rith Nuashonrú an Chórais tú féin "
"chun nuashonrú."

msgid ""
"Automatic updates are off: nothing updates until you run System Update yourself.\n"
"\n"
"Recommended: Turn on. Everything then updates by itself every day at 4 am, and updates fix security problems."
msgstr ""
"Tá nuashonruithe uathoibríocha casta as: ní nuashonrófar aon rud go dtí go rithfidh tú Nuashonrú an Chórais tú féin.\n"
"\n"
"Molta: Cas air. Ansin nuashonraítear gach rud leis féin gach lá ag 4 r.n., agus réitíonn na nuashonruithe fadhbanna slándála."

msgid "Automatic updates are on."
msgstr "Tá nuashonruithe uathoibríocha casta air."

msgid ""
"Automatic updates are on: everything updates by itself every day at 4 am.\n"
"\n"
"Recommended: Keep them on. Updates fix security problems.\n"
"\n"
"Or Turn off: nothing updates until you run System Update yourself."
msgstr ""
"Tá nuashonruithe uathoibríocha casta air: nuashonraítear gach rud leis féin gach lá ag 4 r.n.\n"
"\n"
"Molta: Coinnigh iad casta air. Réitíonn nuashonruithe fadhbanna slándála.\n"
"\n"
"Nó Cas as: ní nuashonrófar aon rud go dtí go rithfidh tú Nuashonrú an Chórais tú féin."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Automatic updates are paused until {day}"
msgstr "Tá na nuashonruithe uathoibríocha curtha ar sos go dtí {day}"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Automatic updates are paused until {day}, after an undo, so the bad update doesn't come back. They turn back on by themselves.\n"
"\n"
"Recommended: Keep the pause.\n"
"\n"
"Or Resume now: the next daily update runs as normal. Or Turn off: nothing updates until you run System Update yourself."
msgstr ""
"Tá nuashonruithe uathoibríocha ar sos go dtí {day}, tar éis cealú, ionas nach dtiocfaidh an drochnuashonrú ar ais. Casfar air arís iad leo féin.\n"
"\n"
"Molta: Coinnigh an sos.\n"
"\n"
"Nó Cuir ar siúl arís anois: rithfidh an chéad nuashonrú laethúil eile mar is gnách. Nó Cas as: ní nuashonrófar aon rud go dtí go rithfidh tú Nuashonrú an Chórais tú féin."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Automatic updates are paused until {day}, so the bad update doesn't come "
"back. They turn back on by themselves."
msgstr ""
"Tá nuashonruithe uathoibríocha ar sos go dtí {day}, ionas nach dtiocfaidh an "
"drochnuashonrú ar ais. Casfar air arís iad leo féin."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Automatic updates are paused until {day}, so the same update doesn't come "
"straight back. They turn back on by themselves."
msgstr ""
"Tá nuashonruithe uathoibríocha ar sos go dtí {day}, ionas nach dtiocfaidh an "
"nuashonrú céanna ar ais láithreach. Casfar air arís iad leo féin."

msgid ""
"Automatic updates are still paused after the undo. Resume them in Automatic "
"updates."
msgstr ""
"Tá nuashonruithe uathoibríocha fós ar sos tar éis an cealaithe. Cuir ar siúl "
"iad arís i Nuashonruithe uathoibríocha."

msgid ""
"Automatic updates could not be paused, so the next one may bring the update "
"back. If it does, turn off Automatic updates in Wheelhouse and tell your "
"helper."
msgstr ""
"Níorbh fhéidir na nuashonruithe uathoibríocha a chur ar sos, mar sin "
"d'fhéadfadh an chéad cheann eile an nuashonrú a thabhairt ar ais. Má "
"tharlaíonn sé sin, cas as Nuashonruithe uathoibríocha in Wheelhouse agus inis"
" do do chúntóir."

msgid ""
"Automatic updates pause for 3 days, so the same update doesn't come straight "
"back. They turn back on by themselves."
msgstr ""
"Cuirtear nuashonruithe uathoibríocha ar sos ar feadh 3 lá, ionas nach "
"dtiocfaidh an nuashonrú céanna ar ais láithreach. Casfar air arís iad leo "
"féin."

msgid ""
"Automatic updates then pause for 3 days, so the bad update doesn't come "
"straight back. If the problem returns after that, turn off Automatic updates "
"in Wheelhouse and tell your helper."
msgstr ""
"Ansin cuirtear nuashonruithe uathoibríocha ar sos ar feadh 3 lá, ionas nach "
"dtiocfaidh an drochnuashonrú ar ais láithreach. Má thagann an fhadhb ar ais "
"ina dhiaidh sin, cas as Nuashonruithe uathoibríocha in Wheelhouse agus inis "
"do do chúntóir."

msgid "Automatic updates, undoing an update, firmware and certificate alerts"
msgstr ""
"Nuashonruithe uathoibríocha, nuashonrú a chealú, foláirimh faoi dhochtearraí "
"agus faoi dheimhnithe"

msgid ""
"Away from home, the switch shows off: sharing only runs on a Home network, "
"and comes back by itself there."
msgstr ""
"Nuair atá tú as baile, taispeántar an lasc casta as: ní ritheann an "
"chomhroinnt ach ar líonra Baile, agus tagann sí ar ais léi féin ansin."

msgid "BIOS settings"
msgstr "Socruithe BIOS"

msgid "Back"
msgstr "Siar"

msgid "Back to the original"
msgstr "Ar ais go dtí an bunleagan"

