msgstr ""
"Cúlra: cliceáil ar phictiúr. Chun do ghrianghraf féin a úsáid, cliceáil Add "
"Picture (cuir pictiúr leis)."

msgid "Basic graphics only"
msgstr "Grafaicí bunúsacha amháin"

msgid "Battery status"
msgstr "Stádas an chadhnra"

msgid "Bazaar is open. Close it when you're done looking."
msgstr "Tá Bazaar oscailte. Dún é nuair a bheidh tú réidh ag breathnú."

msgid "Bazaar, the app store (Flathub)"
msgstr "Bazaar, an siopa aipeanna (Flathub)"

msgid ""
"Before you unplug it, click the eject button next to its name, and wait until"
" it's gone from the list."
msgstr ""
"Sula ndíphlugálann tú é, cliceáil an cnaipe Díchuir in aice lena ainm, agus "
"fan go dtí go mbeidh sé imithe ón liosta."

msgid "Bluetooth"
msgstr "Bluetooth"

