msgstr "Iontrálacha tosaithe a athainmneofar mar \"%s\":"

msgid "Boot options"
msgstr "Roghanna tosaithe"

msgid "Boot options in Wheelhouse can change them back later."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir le Roghanna tosaithe in Wheelhouse iad a athrú ar ais níos déanaí."

msgid "Both"
msgstr "An dá cheann"

msgid "Both ask for your password, and work only on Home."
msgstr ""
"Iarrann an dá cheann d'fhocal faire, agus ní oibríonn siad ach ar líonra "
"Baile."

msgid "Bottom bar and a start menu"
msgstr "Barra íochtarach agus roghchlár tosaigh"

msgid "Box"
msgstr "Bosca"

msgid "Broadcom Wi-Fi chip found. Its driver or firmware can't be included."
msgstr ""
"Fuarthas slis Wi-Fi Broadcom. Ní féidir a thiománaí ná a dhochtearraí a chur "
"san áireamh."

msgid "Browse and install apps in Bazaar. They update on their own."
msgstr ""
"Brabhsáil agus suiteáil aipeanna i mBazaar. Nuashonraíonn siad iad féin."

msgid "Camera"
msgstr "Ceamara"

msgid "Camera found."
msgstr "Fuarthas ceamara."

msgid "Can install software and change system settings. Click to turn it off."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir leis bogearraí a shuiteáil agus socruithe an chórais a athrú. "
"Cliceáil chun é a chasadh as."

msgid "Can install software and change system settings. Click to turn it on."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir leis bogearraí a shuiteáil agus socruithe an chórais a athrú. "
"Cliceáil chun é a chasadh air."

msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Cealaigh"

msgid "Certificate"
msgstr "Deimhniú"

msgid "Certificate alert"
msgstr "Foláireamh deimhnithe"

msgid "Certificate alerts"
msgstr "Foláirimh deimhnithe"

msgid ""
"Certificates are how the computer knows a secure website is real. An alert "
"shows when one has expired, expires soon, or was removed."
msgstr ""
"Is iad deimhnithe an dóigh a bhfuil a fhios ag an ríomhaire go bhfuil suíomh "
"gréasáin slán fíor. Taispeántar foláireamh nuair a bhíonn ceann díobh imithe "
"in éag, ag dul in éag go luath, nó bainte."

msgid "Change"
msgstr "Athraigh"

msgid "Change Scale. A bigger number makes everything bigger."
msgstr ""
"Athraigh Scale (an scála). Má tá an uimhir níos mó, bíonn gach rud níos mó."

msgid "Change a Wheelhouse setting"
msgstr "Athraigh socrú Wheelhouse"

msgid "Change it"
msgstr "Athraigh é"

msgid "Change the kernel settings the computer starts with"
msgstr "Athraigh na socruithe eithne lena dtosaíonn an ríomhaire"

msgid "Change the layout"
msgstr "Athraigh an leagan amach"

msgid "Change the wallpaper to the next picture in a folder"
msgstr "Athraigh an cúlbhrat go dtí an chéad phictiúr eile i bhfillteán"

msgid ""
"Changed your mind? Open Undo the last update again and click Use the newer "
"version."
msgstr ""
"An bhfuil d’intinn athraithe agat? Oscail Cealaigh an nuashonrú deireanach "
"arís agus cliceáil Úsáid an leagan níos nuaí."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Changing {title}"
msgstr "{title} á athrú"

msgid ""
"Check everything. Click a line to change it, or click Install to put "
"EvenKeelOS on the disk."
msgstr ""
"Seiceáil gach rud. Cliceáil ar líne chun í a athrú, nó cliceáil ar Suiteáil "
"chun EvenKeelOS a chur ar an diosca."

msgid "Check that automatic rollback works"
msgstr "Seiceáil go n-oibríonn an rolladh siar uathoibríoch"

msgid "Check that it can't break"
msgstr "Seiceáil nach féidir leis briseadh"

msgid ""
"Check that the computer goes back by itself when a new version won't start, "
"and puts back deleted settings"
msgstr ""
"Seiceáil go dtéann an ríomhaire ar ais leis féin nuair nach dtosaíonn leagan "
"nua, agus go gcuireann sé socruithe scriosta ar ais"

msgid "Check the BIOS's storage settings."
msgstr "Seiceáil socruithe stórála an BIOS."

msgid "Check the boxes"
msgstr "Seiceáil na boscaí"

msgid "Checked against its own docs"
msgstr "Seiceáilte i gcoinne a cháipéisíochta féin"

msgid "Checked every day too"
msgstr "Seiceáiltear é gach lá freisin"

msgid "Checking for firmware updates."
msgstr "Ag seiceáil an bhfuil nuashonruithe dochtearraí ann."

msgid "Checking sharing…"
msgstr "Ag seiceáil na comhroinnte…"

msgid "Checking the network…"
msgstr "Ag seiceáil an líonra…"

