msgstr "Ag seiceáil an bhfuil {name} ag Fedora."

msgid "Checking…"
msgstr "Ag seiceáil…"

msgid "Choose"
msgstr "Roghnaigh"

msgid "Choose apps from .rpm or .deb files that start when you log in"
msgstr ""
"Roghnaigh aipeanna ó chomhaid .rpm nó .deb a thosaíonn nuair a logálann tú "
"isteach"

msgid "Choose which app opens a file"
msgstr "Roghnaigh cén aip a osclóidh comhad"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Chosen: automatic, from {servers}."
msgstr "Roghnaíodh: uathoibríoch, ó {servers}."

msgid "Chosen: don't encrypt."
msgstr "Roghnaíodh: ná criptigh."

msgid "Chosen: enabled."
msgstr "Roghnaíodh: cumasaithe."

msgid "Chosen: encrypt."
msgstr "Roghnaíodh: criptigh."

msgid "Chosen: locked."
msgstr "Roghnaíodh: faoi ghlas."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Chosen: {disk}."
msgstr "Roghnaíodh: {disk}."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Chosen: {names}."
msgstr "Roghnaíodh: {names}."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Chosen: {name}."
msgstr "Roghnaíodh: {name}."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Chosen: {time}."
msgstr "Roghnaíodh: {time}."

msgid ""
"Click Add a folder and pick it. It starts as Read only: change it to Read and"
" write if the other computer should save there too."
msgstr ""
"Cliceáil Cuir fillteán leis agus roghnaigh é. Tosaíonn sé mar Léamh amháin: "
"athraigh go Léamh agus scríobh é más ceart don ríomhaire eile sábháil ann "
"freisin."

msgid "Click Apply, then Keep Changes if it looks right."
msgstr ""
"Cliceáil Cuir i bhFeidhm, ansin Coimeád Athruithe má tá cuma cheart air."

msgid "Click Back to the original to undo all of it."
msgstr "Cliceáil Ar ais go dtí an bunleagan chun é ar fad a chealú."

msgid ""
"Click Free up disk space, then Free up space. Your files and apps aren't "
"touched."
msgstr ""
"Cliceáil Saor spás diosca, ansin Saor spás. Ní bhaintear le do chuid comhad "
"ná aipeanna."

msgid ""
"Click Install the driver, type your password, and restart. Then add the "
"printer."
msgstr ""
"Cliceáil Suiteáil an tiománaí, clóscríobh d'fhocal faire, agus atosaigh. "
"Ansin cuir an printéir leis."

msgid "Click Install, and it installs that instead."
msgstr "Cliceáil Suiteáil, agus suiteálfaidh sé é sin ina ionad."

msgid ""
"Click Let an app in, type its name, like Minecraft or Jellyfin, and click it."
msgstr ""
"Cliceáil Lig aip isteach, clóscríobh a hainm, mar shampla Minecraft nó "
"Jellyfin, agus cliceáil uirthi."

msgid ""
"Click Restart to start EvenKeelOS. Click Save the log to put the details of "
"this install on a second USB stick."
msgstr ""
"Cliceáil Atosaigh chun EvenKeelOS a thosú. Cliceáil Sábháil an loga chun "
"sonraí na suiteála seo a chur ar dhara cuimhneán USB."

msgid ""
"Click Save details. It makes one file of recent errors, in Documents. Nothing"
" is sent anywhere."
msgstr ""
"Cliceáil ar Sábháil na sonraí. Cruthaíonn sé comhad amháin de na hearráidí is"
" déanaí, i gCáipéisí. Ní sheoltar aon rud áit ar bith."

msgid "Click Show the file, then attach it to an email to your helper."
msgstr ""
"Cliceáil Taispeáin an comhad, ansin ceangail é le ríomhphost chuig do "
"chúntóir."

msgid "Click Test to hear each speaker."
msgstr "Cliceáil Test (Tástáil) chun gach callaire a chloisteáil."

msgid "Click Turn off or Turn on. Turning them off asks for your password."
msgstr ""
"Cliceáil Cas as nó Cas air. Iarrtar d'fhocal faire chun iad a chasadh as."

msgid "Click Turn on, type the disk password once, and restart."
msgstr ""
"Cliceáil Cas air, clóscríobh focal faire an diosca uair amháin, agus "
"atosaigh."

msgid ""
"Click Undo the update, type your password, and restart. Your files and apps "
"aren't touched."
msgstr ""
"Cliceáil Cealaigh an nuashonrú, clóscríobh d'fhocal faire, agus atosaigh. Ní "
"bhaintear le do chuid comhad ná aipeanna."

msgid ""
"Click a font to pick another, or change Text size. 1.00 is the normal size."
msgstr ""
"Cliceáil ar chineál cló chun ceann eile a roghnú, nó athraigh Méid an téacs. "
"Is é 1.00 an gnáthmhéid."

msgid "Click the USB stick to save them on."
msgstr "Cliceáil an cuimhneán USB chun iad a shábháil air."

msgid ""
"Click the clock to see your notifications and the calendar. Or press Windows "
"key + V."
msgstr ""
"Cliceáil ar an gclog chun d’fhógraí agus an féilire a fheiceáil. Nó brúigh "
"eochair Windows + V."

msgid "Click the copy button next to a command, then paste it in Terminal."
msgstr ""
"Cliceáil an cnaipe cóipeála in aice le hordú, ansin greamaigh é sa "
"Teirminéal."

msgid "Click the device's name when it shows in the list."
msgstr "Cliceáil ar ainm an ghléis nuair a thaispeántar é sa liosta."

msgid ""
"Click the icons at the end of the bar, then the arrow next to Wi-Fi. Or open "
"Settings, Wi-Fi."
msgstr ""
"Cliceáil ar na deilbhíní ag deireadh an bharra, ansin ar an tsaighead in aice"
" le Wi-Fi. Nó oscail Socruithe, Wi-Fi."

msgid ""
"Click the icons at the end of the bar: the bottom right with the Windows-"
"style layout, the top right with the standard one. Or press Windows key + S."
msgstr ""
"Cliceáil ar na deilbhíní ag deireadh an bharra: an ceann ar an taobh "
"íochtarach deas leis an leagan amach i stíl Windows, agus an ceann ar an "
"taobh uachtarach deas leis an leagan amach caighdeánach. Nó brúigh eochair "
"Windows + S."

msgid ""
"Click the magnifying glass, or press Ctrl+F, and type to search this folder "
"and the folders in it."
msgstr ""
"Cliceáil ar an ngloine formhéadúcháin, nó brúigh Ctrl+F, agus clóscríobh chun"
" an fillteán seo agus na fillteáin atá ann a chuardach."

msgid "Click the meeting link you were sent."
msgstr "Cliceáil ar an nasc cruinnithe a seoladh chugat."

msgid "Click the network's name, type its password, and press Enter."
msgstr ""
"Cliceáil ar ainm an líonra, clóscríobh a fhocal faire, agus brúigh Enter."

msgid ""
"Click the printer when it shows, then Add. Most printers need nothing else."
msgstr ""
"Cliceáil ar an bprintéir nuair a thaispeántar é, ansin cliceáil ar Cuir Leis."
" Ní theastaíonn aon rud eile ó fhormhór na bprintéirí."

msgid "Clock"
msgstr "Clog"

msgid "Clock sync"
msgstr "Sioncronú an chloig"

msgid "Close"
msgstr "Dún"

msgid "Close it again"
msgstr "Dún é arís"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Close {name} again"
msgstr "Dún {name} arís"

msgid "Code and terminal"
msgstr "Cód agus teirminéal"

msgid "Collecting the problem details."
msgstr "Sonraí na faidhbe á mbailiú."

msgid "Colors and wallpaper"
