msgstr ""
"Má tharlaíonn sé arís, inis do do chúntóir. Déanann Sábháil sonraí na faidhbe"
" in Wheelhouse comhad chun iad a sheoladh."

msgid "If it started after an update, go back to the version from before it"
msgstr ""
"Má thosaigh sé tar éis nuashonraithe, téigh ar ais go dtí an leagan a bhí ann"
" roimhe sin"

msgid ""
"If something stopped working after an update, open Wheelhouse, Updates, Undo "
"the last update."
msgstr ""
"Má stop rud éigin ag obair i ndiaidh nuashonraithe, oscail Wheelhouse, "
"Nuashonruithe, Cealaigh an nuashonrú deireanach."

msgid "If something went wrong"
msgstr "Má chuaigh rud éigin ar seachrán"

msgid "If the computer won't start properly"
msgstr "Mura dtosaíonn an ríomhaire i gceart"

msgid ""
"If the disk is encrypted, its password is typed when the computer starts, "
"before EvenKeelOS loads. Which keyboard layout is used then?"
msgstr ""
"Má tá an diosca criptithe, clóscríobhtar a fhocal faire nuair a thosaíonn an "
"ríomhaire, sula lódáiltear EvenKeelOS. Cén leagan amach méarchláir a "
"úsáidtear ansin?"

msgid ""
"If updates are listed, click Update and type your password. Some finish while"
" the computer restarts."
msgstr ""
"Má tá nuashonruithe liostaithe, cliceáil Nuashonraigh agus clóscríobh "
"d'fhocal faire. Críochnaíonn cuid acu agus an ríomhaire ag atosú."

msgid ""
"If you type a disk password every time the computer starts, it can unlock by "
"itself with the computer's security chip."
msgstr ""
"Má chlóscríobhann tú focal faire diosca gach uair a thosaíonn an ríomhaire, "
"is féidir leis an diosca díghlasáil leis féin le slis slándála an ríomhaire."

msgid ""
"If yours does, download the maker's .rpm file and open it from Downloads. "
"Wheelhouse sees that it's a printer driver."
msgstr ""
"Má dhéanann do cheann é sin, íoslódáil comhad .rpm an déantóra agus oscail é "
"ó Íoslódálacha. Feiceann Wheelhouse gur tiománaí printéara é."

msgid "Important settings deleted"
msgstr "Socruithe tábhachtacha scriosta"

msgid ""
"Important system settings are really deleted, and the computer restarts right"
" away. The next start finds them missing, puts them back from the copy it "
"saved, and restarts once more by itself. A message at login then lists what "
"was put back."
msgstr ""
"Scriostar socruithe tábhachtacha an chórais i ndáiríre, agus atosaíonn an "
"ríomhaire láithreach. Ag an gcéad tosú eile, aimsítear go bhfuil siad ar "
"iarraidh, cuirtear ar ais iad ón gcóip a sábháladh, agus atosaíonn sé uair "
"amháin eile leis féin. Liostaíonn teachtaireacht ag logáil isteach ansin cad "
"a cuireadh ar ais."

msgid ""
"In a box it updates with System Update; added to the system it never updates."
msgstr ""
"I mbosca, nuashonraítear é le Nuashonrú an Chórais; má chuirtear leis an "
"gcóras é, ní nuashonraítear choíche é."

msgid "In the box, these won't work:"
msgstr "Sa bhosca, ní oibreoidh na cinn seo:"

