"It gives anyone at the keyboard a shell with full control, with no password."
msgstr ""
"Tugann sé blaosc le smacht iomlán do dhuine ar bith ag an méarchlár, gan aon "
"fhocal faire."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "It goes in the {label} and updates with System Update."
msgstr ""
"Téann sé isteach sa {label} agus nuashonraítear é le Nuashonrú an Chórais."

msgid "It has no app of its own; other apps in the box use it."
msgstr "Níl a aip féin aige; úsáideann aipeanna eile sa bhosca é."

msgid "It has no window of its own in Show Apps."
msgstr "Níl a fhuinneog féin aige in Show Apps."

msgid "It is a command-line tool, so it has no window in Show Apps."
msgstr ""
"Is uirlis líne na n-orduithe é, mar sin níl aon fhuinneog aige in Show Apps."

msgid "It is made for a different kind of processor than this computer has."
msgstr ""
"Tá sé ceaptha do chineál próiseálaí atá difriúil leis an gceann atá sa "
"ríomhaire seo."

msgid ""
"It may not work yet. When it does, it works in Firefox and the Camera app, "
"not every app."
msgstr ""
"B’fhéidir nach n-oibreoidh sé go fóill. Nuair a oibríonn sé, oibríonn sé i "
"Firefox agus san aip Ceamara, ní i ngach aip."

msgid ""
"It needs parts that the Ubuntu box (Ubuntu 24.04) does not have. It may be "
"made for a newer or older Ubuntu."
msgstr ""
"Teastaíonn uaidh codanna nach bhfuil sa bhosca Ubuntu (Ubuntu 24.04). "
"D’fhéadfadh sé a bheith déanta le haghaidh leagan níos nuaí nó níos sine "
"d’Ubuntu."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"It needs {name}, which Fedora {version} does not have. It may be made for a "
