msgstr ""
"Teastaíonn {name} uaidh, rud nach bhfuil ag Fedora {version}. B’fhéidir go "
"bhfuil sé déanta le haghaidh leagan difriúil de Fedora."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"It needs {name}, which the Ubuntu box (Ubuntu 24.04) does not have. It may be"
" made for a newer or older Ubuntu."
msgstr ""
"Teastaíonn {name} uaidh, rud nach bhfuil ag an mbosca Ubuntu (Ubuntu 24.04). "
"D’fhéadfadh sé a bheith déanta le haghaidh leagan níos nuaí nó níos sine de "
"Ubuntu."

msgid "It never updates."
msgstr "Ní dhéanann sé nuashonrú choíche."

msgid ""
"It opens file sharing ports: folders are shared only on Home networks, in "
"Shared folders."
msgstr ""
"Osclaíonn sé poirt chomhroinnte comhad: ní roinntear fillteáin ach ar líonraí"
" Baile, in Fillteáin chomhroinnte."

msgid "It says first whether the app keeps itself updated, then installs it."
msgstr ""
"Deir sé ar dtús an gcoinníonn an aip í féin cothrom le dáta, agus ansin "
"suiteálann sé í."

msgid "It starts when you restart the computer."
msgstr "Tosaíonn sé nuair a atosaíonn tú an ríomhaire."

msgid ""
"It stops a driver from loading. If it's the drive's or the screen's driver, "
"the computer won't start."
msgstr ""
"Cuireann sé stop le tiománaí ó lódáil. Más é tiománaí an tiomántáin nó "
"tiománaí an scáileáin atá i gceist, ní thosóidh an ríomhaire."

msgid ""
"It tells you whether there's a version for EvenKeelOS, or a replacement that "
"does the same job."
msgstr ""
"Insíonn sé duit an bhfuil leagan ann do EvenKeelOS, nó ionadach a dhéanann an"
" obair chéanna."

msgid ""
"It turns off SELinux, which keeps apps and services from reaching what they "
"shouldn't."
msgstr ""
"Múchann sé SELinux, a choisceann ar aipeanna agus ar sheirbhísí teacht ar "
"rudaí nár cheart dóibh."

msgid "It turns off or weakens a security protection."
msgstr "Múchann sé cosaint slándála nó laghdaíonn sé í."

msgid "It turns off protection against processor security flaws."
msgstr "Múchann sé an chosaint i gcoinne lochtanna slándála sa phróiseálaí."

msgid ""
"It turns off the graphics driver: low resolution, no outside screens, and "
"sleep may not work."
msgstr ""
"Múchann sé an tiománaí grafaicí: beidh an taifeach íseal, ní bheidh scáileáin"
" sheachtracha ann, agus b’fhéidir nach n-oibreoidh an mód codlata."

msgid "It updates by itself."
msgstr "Nuashonraíonn sé é féin."

msgid ""
"It would replace a file that belongs to the system, so it was not added."
msgstr ""
"Chuirfeadh sé rud eile in ionad comhaid a bhaineann leis an gcóras, mar sin "
"níor cuireadh leis é."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "It's already set: the version from {date} starts at your next restart."
msgstr ""
"Tá sé socraithe cheana féin: tosóidh an leagan ó {date} ag an gcéad atosú "
"eile."

msgid "It's in Wheelhouse if you want it again."
msgstr "Tá sé in Wheelhouse má theastaíonn sé uait arís."

msgid "It's on. From your next restart, the disk unlocks by itself."
msgstr ""
"Tá sé casta air. Ón gcéad atosú eile, díghlasálfaidh an diosca leis féin."

msgid ""
"Its file changed or holds more than one certificate, so nothing was removed. "
"Tell your helper."
msgstr ""
"D'athraigh a chomhad nó tá níos mó ná deimhniú amháin ann, mar sin níor "
"baineadh aon rud. Inis do do chúntóir."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Its file is removed, but \"{name}\" is still trusted: it was added somewhere "
"else too. Tell your helper."
msgstr ""
"Baineadh an comhad, ach tá \"{name}\" fós iontaofa: cuireadh leis in áit "
"éigin eile freisin. Inis do do chúntóir."

