msgid ""
"Right now you type the disk password every time the computer starts.\n"
"\n"
"Secure Boot is off on this computer, so this would be less safe: someone could change how the computer starts and still get the disk unlocked.\n"
"\n"
"Recommended: Cancel, then turn Secure Boot on in the BIOS settings first (Restart into BIOS settings, in Wheelhouse).\n"
"\n"
"Or Turn on anyway."
msgstr ""
"Faoi láthair, clóscríobhann tú focal faire an diosca gach uair a thosaíonn an ríomhaire.\n"
"\n"
"Tá Tosú Slán casta as ar an ríomhaire seo, mar sin bheadh sé seo níos lú sábháilte: d'fhéadfadh duine an dóigh a dtosaíonn an ríomhaire a athrú agus an diosca a fháil díghlasáilte fós.\n"
"\n"
"Molta: Cealaigh, ansin cas air Tosú Slán i socruithe an BIOS ar dtús (Atosaigh isteach i socruithe an BIOS, in Wheelhouse).\n"
"\n"
"Nó Cas air ar aon chuma."

