msgid ""
"Some important system settings were broken, and putting them back didn't fix the start, so your computer went back to the version from {since}, which has its own settings. Your files and apps aren't touched, and automatic updates aren't paused.\n"
"\n"
"Tell your helper. Save problem details in Wheelhouse makes a file to send them."
msgstr ""
"Bhí roinnt socruithe tábhachtacha an chórais briste, agus níor réitigh a gcur ar ais an tosú, mar sin d'fhill do ríomhaire ar an leagan ó {since}, a bhfuil a shocruithe féin aige. Ní bhaintear le do chuid comhad ná aipeanna, agus níl na nuashonruithe uathoibríocha ar sos.\n"
"\n"
"Inis do do chúntóir. Déanann Sábháil sonraí na faidhbe in Wheelhouse comhad chun iad a sheoladh."

msgid ""
"Some video formats (like most web video) need extra codecs that Fedora, and "
"this system, leave out because of patents in some countries. Installing them "
"is your choice and your responsibility.\\n\\nWeb video only: lets Firefox "
"play most web video. A small addition to the system.\\n\\nEverything: plays "
"all common video and audio, in every app. It replaces some parts of the "
"system, so system updates take a little longer.\\n\\nNot now: they're in "
"Wheelhouse, Apps, Media codecs, any time.\\n\\nPick by what you need. If you "
"only watch video in Firefox, Web video only is enough."
msgstr ""
"Teastaíonn codecanna breise ó roinnt formáidí físe (mar shampla formhór na "
"bhfíseán gréasáin) a fhágann Fedora, agus an córas seo, amach mar gheall ar "
"phaitinní i roinnt tíortha. Is fútsa atá sé iad a shuiteáil, agus is ortsa "
"atá an fhreagracht.\\n\\nFíseán gréasáin amháin: ligeann sé do Firefox "
"formhór na bhfíseán gréasáin a sheinm. Breis bheag ar an gcóras.\\n\\nGach "
"rud: seinneann sé gach físeán agus fuaim choitianta, i ngach aip. Cuireann sé"
" codanna eile in ionad roinnt codanna den chóras, mar sin tógann "
"nuashonruithe an chórais beagán níos faide.\\n\\nNí anois: tá siad in "
"Wheelhouse, Aipeanna, Codecanna meán, am ar bith.\\n\\nRoghnaigh de réir an "
"mhéid a theastaíonn uait. Mura bhféachann tú ar fhíseáin ach in Firefox, is "
"leor Físeán gréasáin amháin."

msgid ""
