"The BIOS screen uses the keyboard. When you're done, choose Save and Exit, or"
" Exit."
msgstr ""
"Úsáideann scáileán an BIOS an méarchlár. Nuair a bheidh tú réidh, roghnaigh "
"Save and Exit, nó Exit."

msgid ""
"The BIOS's RAID setting (Intel RST) hides the disk. Restart into the BIOS and"
" set the storage mode (often called SATA mode or SATA operation) to AHCI. "
"Windows on this disk won't start after that change, but installing EvenKeelOS"
" erases it anyway."
msgstr ""
"Folaíonn socrú RAID an BIOS (Intel RST) an diosca. Atosaigh isteach sa BIOS "
"agus socraigh an mód stórála (ar a dtugtar go minic mód SATA nó oibriú SATA) "
"go AHCI. Ní thosóidh Windows ar an diosca seo tar éis an athraithe sin, ach "
"scriosfaidh suiteáil EvenKeelOS é ar aon chuma."

msgid "The Bluetooth driver is blocked, so there's no Bluetooth."
msgstr "Tá an tiománaí Bluetooth bactha, mar sin níl aon Bluetooth ann."

msgid ""
"The NVIDIA card runs on the open-source driver built into EvenKeelOS. The "
"proprietary NVIDIA driver isn't used: it breaks too often to keep the promise"
" that EvenKeelOS just works. If you need it, use Bazzite or Bluefin's NVIDIA "
"editions instead."
msgstr ""
"Úsáideann an cárta NVIDIA an tiománaí foinse oscailte atá ionsuite in "
"EvenKeelOS. Ní úsáidtear tiománaí dílseánaigh NVIDIA: briseann sé rómhinic le"
" go gcoinneofaí an gealltanas go n-oibríonn EvenKeelOS gan stró. Má "
"theastaíonn sé uait, úsáid eagráin NVIDIA Bazzite nó Bluefin ina ionad."

msgid "The QR code could not be made. Save the log to a stick instead."
msgstr ""
"Níorbh fhéidir an cód QR a dhéanamh. Sábháil an loga ar chuimhneán ina ionad."

