msgstr "Níorbh fhéidir an cuimhneán USB a oscailt."

msgid "The VPN list is missing."
msgstr "Tá an liosta VPN ar iarraidh."

msgid "The Wi-Fi card's driver is blocked, so there's no Wi-Fi."
msgstr "Tá tiománaí an chárta Wi-Fi bactha, mar sin níl aon Wi-Fi ann."

msgid "The administrator password was not given, so nothing was changed."
msgstr "Níor tugadh focal faire an riarthóra, mar sin níor athraíodh aon rud."

