"cuireann an chéad tosú eile ar ais iad."

msgid "The settings repair test didn't work."
msgstr "Níor oibrigh an tástáil ar dheisiú na socruithe."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The settings repair test didn't work: your computer couldn't put the deleted settings back, so it went back to the version from {since}, which has its own settings. Your files and apps aren't touched, and automatic updates aren't paused.\n"
"\n"
"Tell your helper. Save problem details in Wheelhouse makes a file to send them."
msgstr ""
"Níor oibrigh an tástáil ar dheisiú na socruithe: níorbh fhéidir le do ríomhaire na socruithe scriosta a chur ar ais, mar sin d'fhill sé ar an leagan ó {since}, a bhfuil a shocruithe féin aige. Ní bhaintear le do chuid comhad ná aipeanna, agus níl na nuashonruithe uathoibríocha ar sos.\n"
"\n"
"Inis do do chúntóir. Déanann Sábháil sonraí na faidhbe in Wheelhouse comhad chun iad a sheoladh."

msgid "The settings repair test worked."
msgstr "D'oibrigh an tástáil ar dheisiú na socruithe."

msgid "The sound chip's driver is blocked, so there's no sound."
msgstr "Tá tiománaí na slise fuaime bactha, mar sin níl aon fhuaim ann."

msgid ""
"The start menu, windows, the menu at the end of the bar, notifications, "
"screenshots and shortcuts"
msgstr ""
"An roghchlár tosaigh, fuinneoga, an roghchlár ag deireadh an bharra, fógraí, "
"gabhálacha scáileáin agus aicearraí"

msgid "The sun doesn't set or rise here today, so it's dark until it rises."
msgstr ""
"Ní théann an ghrian faoi ná ní éiríonn sí anseo inniu, mar sin beidh sé "
"dorcha go dtí go n-éireoidh sí."

msgid "The sun doesn't set or rise here today, so it's light until it sets."
msgstr ""
"Ní théann an ghrian faoi ná ní éiríonn sí anseo inniu, mar sin tá sé geal go "
"dtí go dtéann sí faoi."

msgid "The system core crashed (a protection fault)"
msgstr "Thuairteáil croí an chórais (locht cosanta)"

msgid "The system core crashed (an oops)"
msgstr "Thuairteáil croí an chórais (oops)"

msgid "The system core reported a bug"
msgstr "Thuairiscigh croí an chórais fabht"

msgid ""
"The system itself can't be changed by apps or by mistake. Each update "
"replaces it whole."
msgstr ""
"Ní féidir le haipeanna ná le botún an córas féin a athrú. Cuireann gach "
"nuashonrú córas iomlán nua ina áit."

#, python-brace-format
