#, python-brace-format
msgid "The touchpad ({device})"
msgstr "An ceap tadhaill ({device})"

msgid "The two don't match yet."
msgstr "Níl an dá cheann mar a chéile fós."

msgid "The update did not finish. Details: journalctl -u %s"
msgstr "Níor chríochnaigh an nuashonrú. Sonraí: journalctl -u %s"

msgid "The update didn't finish."
msgstr "Níor chríochnaigh an nuashonrú."

msgid ""
"The update didn't finish. Nothing is broken: your computer keeps running the "
"version it has.\\n\\nTry again later."
msgstr ""
"Níor chríochnaigh an nuashonrú. Níl aon rud briste: tá do ríomhaire fós ag "
"rith an leagan atá aige.\\n\\nBain triail as arís níos déanaí."

msgid "The update program"
msgstr "An clár nuashonraithe"

msgid ""
"The update program is swapped for one that always fails (until the next "
"restart; nothing on the disk changes)."
msgstr ""
"Cuirtear clár a theipeann i gcónaí in ionad an chláir nuashonraithe (go dtí "
"an chéad atosú eile; ní athraítear aon rud ar an diosca)."

msgid "The user name is empty."
msgstr "Tá an t-ainm úsáideora folamh."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The version you're using now is from {current}. The one from before it, from {older}, is still on this computer.\n"
"\n"
"If something stopped working after the last update: Undo the update. The version from {older} starts at your next restart. Your files and your apps aren't touched."
msgstr ""
"Is ó {current} an leagan atá á úsáid agat anois. Tá an ceann roimhe, ó {older}, fós ar an ríomhaire seo.\n"
"\n"
"Má stop rud éigin ag obair tar éis an nuashonraithe dheireanaigh: Cealaigh an nuashonrú. Tosóidh an leagan ó {older} ag an gcéad atosú eile. Ní bhaintear le do chuid comhad ná aipeanna."

msgid ""
"The version you're using now is the one before it with boot options changed in Wheelhouse.\n"
"\n"
"Undo the change: the computer starts with the boot options it had before, at your next restart. Automatic updates aren't paused.\n"
"\n"
"Or Cancel."
msgstr ""
"Is é an leagan atá á úsáid agat anois an ceann roimhe le roghanna tosaithe athraithe in Wheelhouse.\n"
"\n"
"Cealaigh an t-athrú: tosaíonn an ríomhaire leis na roghanna tosaithe a bhí aige roimhe, ag an gcéad atosú eile. Níl na nuashonruithe uathoibríocha ar sos.\n"
"\n"
"Nó Cealaigh."

msgid "The wallpaper changes to the next picture in a folder of yours."
msgstr ""
"Athraíonn an cúlbhrat go dtí an chéad phictiúr eile i bhfillteán de do chuid."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The {fs} file system could not be loaded, so the disk can't be prepared."
msgstr ""
"Níorbh fhéidir an córas comhad {fs} a lódáil, mar sin ní féidir an diosca a "
"ullmhú."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The {label} is deleted."
msgstr "Tá an {label} scriosta."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The {label} is not working."
msgstr "Níl an {label} ag obair."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The {label} is repaired."
msgstr "Tá an {label} deisithe."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The {label} isn't working.\n"
"\n"
"Recommended: Repair the box. It rebuilds the box, puts your apps back, then installs {title}. Your files aren't touched."
msgstr ""
"Níl an {label} ag obair.\n"
"\n"
"Molta: Deisigh an bosca. Atógann sé an bosca, cuireann sé d'aipeanna ar ais, ansin suiteálann sé {title}. Ní bhaintear le do chuid comhad."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The {name} ({unit})"
msgstr "An {name} ({unit})"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The {name} graphics drive the screen."
msgstr "Is iad na grafaicí {name} a rialaíonn an scáileán."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The {name} service ({unit})"
msgstr "An tseirbhís {name} ({unit})"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The {title} download isn't signed by ArtCraft, so it was not installed."
msgstr ""
"Níl an íoslódáil {title} sínithe ag ArtCraft, mar sin níor suiteáladh í."

msgid "There are no app boxes to repair."
msgstr "Níl aon bhoscaí aipeanna ann le deisiú."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "There is no start-up keyboard layout for {layout}."
msgstr "Níl aon leagan amach méarchláir tosaithe ann do {layout}."

msgid ""
"There's no earlier version on this computer to go back to. Only the version "
"you're using now is kept."
msgstr ""
"Níl aon leagan níos luaithe ar an ríomhaire seo le dul ar ais chuige. Ní "
"choinnítear ach an leagan atá á úsáid agat anois."

msgid ""
"There's no earlier version to fall back to if putting the settings back "
"doesn't work, so the test doesn't run. Try it after the next update."
msgstr ""
"Níl aon leagan níos luaithe ann le filleadh air mura n-oibríonn cur ar ais na"
" socruithe, mar sin ní ritheann an tástáil. Bain triail as tar éis an chéad "
"nuashonraithe eile."

msgid "These security certificates need attention. Pick one to see what to do."
msgstr ""
"Ní mór aird a thabhairt ar na deimhnithe slándála seo. Roghnaigh ceann chun a"
" fheiceáil cad ba chóir a dhéanamh."

msgid "They open in Chrome."
msgstr "Osclaíonn siad i gChrome."

msgid "They open in your usual browser. Choose to be asked about Chrome again."
msgstr ""
"Osclaíonn siad i do ghnáthbhrabhsálaí. Roghnaigh go gcuirfí ceist ort faoi "
"Chrome arís."

msgid "This account can't share folders."
msgstr "Ní féidir leis an gcuntas seo fillteáin a roinnt."

msgid ""
"This computer asks for the disk password every time it starts. The computer's security chip can unlock the disk instead.\n"
"\n"
"This needs the disk password, so it's one for your helper.\n"
"\n"
"Recommended: Set it up. Or Skip: it's in Wheelhouse any time."
msgstr ""
"Iarrann an ríomhaire seo focal faire an diosca gach uair a thosaíonn sé. Is féidir le slis slándála an ríomhaire an diosca a dhíghlasáil ina ionad.\n"
"\n"
"Teastaíonn focal faire an diosca chuige seo, mar sin is jab é do do chúntóir.\n"
"\n"
"Molta: Socraigh é. Nó Scipeáil: tá sé in Wheelhouse am ar bith."

msgid ""
"This computer can't go back by itself: it was installed before automatic "
"rollback was added, or automatic rollback was switched off. Computers "
"installed from a newer USB have it."
msgstr ""
"Ní féidir leis an ríomhaire seo dul ar ais leis féin: suiteáladh é sular "
"cuireadh an rolladh siar uathoibríoch leis, nó casadh as an rolladh siar "
"uathoibríoch. Tá sé ag ríomhairí a suiteáladh ó USB níos nuaí."

msgid ""
"This computer can't open its BIOS settings from here. Press the BIOS key "
"while it starts (often F2, F10, F12 or Delete)."
msgstr ""
"Ní féidir leis an ríomhaire seo a shocruithe BIOS a oscailt ón áit seo. "
"Brúigh an eochair BIOS agus é ag tosú (is minic F2, F10, F12 nó Delete)."

msgid ""
"This computer has no security chip (TPM) that can do this, so the disk "
"password stays."
msgstr ""
"Níl slis slándála (TPM) ar an ríomhaire seo a fhéadann é seo a dhéanamh, mar "
"sin fanann focal faire an diosca."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"This computer is running a test copy ({name}) as its normal version, so a new test can't start from it.\n"
"\n"
"Recommended: Remove the test marker. The version without it starts at your next restart. Needs your password."
msgstr ""
"Tá cóip thástála ({name}) á rith ag an ríomhaire seo mar ghnáthleagan, mar sin ní féidir tástáil nua a thosú uaithi.\n"
"\n"
"Molta: Bain an marcóir tástála. Tosóidh an leagan gan é ag an gcéad atosú eile. Teastaíonn d'fhocal faire."

msgid ""
"This computer is running a test copy. Open Test automatic rollback again to "
"remove its marker."
msgstr ""
"Tá cóip thástála á rith ag an ríomhaire seo. Oscail Tástáil an rolladh siar "
"uathoibríoch arís chun a marcóir a bhaint."

msgid "This computer started the USB stick in old BIOS (legacy) mode."
msgstr "Thosaigh an ríomhaire seo an cuimhneán USB i seanmhód BIOS (legacy)."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"This desktop uses {now}.\n"
"\n"
"Switch to {new}? It takes effect after you log out and back in.\n"
"\n"
"Or Keep it."
msgstr ""
"Úsáideann an deasc seo {now}.\n"
"\n"
"An dteastaíonn uait athrú go {new}? Tiocfaidh sé i bhfeidhm tar éis duit logáil amach agus logáil isteach arís.\n"
"\n"
"Nó Coinnigh é."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"This file can't be installed. It may be damaged or not fully downloaded. Download it again and retry.\n"
"\n"
"(Details: {details})"
msgstr ""
"Ní féidir an comhad seo a shuiteáil. Seans go bhfuil sé damáistithe nó nach bhfuil sé íoslódáilte go hiomlán. Íoslódáil é arís agus bain triail as arís.\n"
"\n"
"(Sonraí: {details})"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"This file is an older version of {title} than the one you have.\n"
"\n"
"Install the older version: replaces yours. Only do this if the newer one has a problem."
msgstr ""
"Is leagan níos sine de {title} an comhad seo ná an ceann atá agat.\n"
"\n"
"Suiteáil an seanleagan: cuireann sé in ionad do cheann féin é. Ná déan é seo ach má tá fadhb leis an gceann níos nuaí."

msgid ""
"This is a live session: it runs from the USB stick, nothing here is saved, "
"and the computer's disk isn't touched."
msgstr ""
"Is seisiún beo é seo: ritheann sé ón gcuimhneán USB, ní shábháiltear aon rud "
"anseo, agus ní bhaintear le diosca an ríomhaire."

msgid ""
"This is how the computer shows up on your network. Keep the suggestion, or "
"type a new one."
msgstr ""
"Seo mar a fheictear an ríomhaire ar do líonra. Coinnigh an moladh, nó "
"clóscríobh ceann nua."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"This is the 32-bit version of {title}, for older computers. Download the "
"64-bit version instead (often called amd64 or x86_64)."
msgstr ""
"Seo an leagan 32-giotáin de {title}, do ríomhairí níos sine. Íoslódáil an "
"leagan 64-giotáin ina ionad sin (tugtar amd64 nó x86_64 air go minic)."

msgid "This network"
msgstr "An líonra seo"

msgid ""
"This removes things the computer no longer needs: unused app parts, old "
"system update files, and unused container images. Your files and your apps "
"aren't touched."
msgstr ""
"Baineann sé seo rudaí nach dteastaíonn ón ríomhaire a thuilleadh: codanna "
"aipeanna nach n-úsáidtear, seanchomhaid nuashonraithe an chórais, agus "
"íomhánna coimeádáin nach n-úsáidtear. Ní bhaintear le do chuid comhad ná "
"aipeanna."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"This saves the computer's recent error messages, its system version and the list of your apps to one file, {name}, in your Documents folder. What your apps showed or opened isn't in it.\n"
"\n"
"Then email that file to your helper. They can see what went wrong without being here.\n"
"\n"
"Nothing is sent anywhere by itself."
msgstr ""
"Sábhálann sé seo teachtaireachtaí earráide is déanaí an ríomhaire, leagan an chórais agus liosta d'aipeanna i gcomhad amháin, {name}, i d'fhillteán Cáipéisí. Níl an méid a thaispeáin nó a d'oscail d'aipeanna ann.\n"
"\n"
"Ansin seol an comhad sin ar ríomhphost chuig do chúntóir. Is féidir leo a fheiceáil cad a chuaigh mícheart gan a bheith anseo.\n"
"\n"
"Ní sheoltar aon rud áit ar bith leis féin."

msgid ""
"This sets what other devices on this network can reach. Pick Public place "
"anywhere you're not sure. You can change it later in Wheelhouse, Network "
"safety."
msgstr ""
"Socraíonn sé seo cad is féidir le gléasanna eile ar an líonra seo a bhaint "
"amach. Roghnaigh Áit phoiblí áit ar bith nach bhfuil tú cinnte. Is féidir "
"leat é a athrú níos déanaí in Wheelhouse, Sábháilteacht an líonra."

msgid ""
"This sets what you see at first. The next step suggests a desktop layout to "
"match, and the guide is in Wheelhouse, Get help, either way."
msgstr ""
"Socraíonn sé seo an méid a fheiceann tú ar dtús. Molann an chéad chéim eile "
"leagan amach deisce a thagann leis, agus tá an treoir le fáil in Wheelhouse, "
"Faigh cabhair, pé slí."

msgid "This setting is risky"
msgstr "Tá an socrú seo contúirteach"

msgid "This start found these broken, as the test expects:"
msgstr ""
"Fuair an tosú seo na rudaí seo briste, mar a bhfuiltear ag súil leis sa "
"tástáil:"

msgid "This start found these still broken, as the test expects:"
msgstr ""
"Fuair an tosú seo na rudaí seo fós briste, mar a bhfuiltear ag súil leis sa "
"tástáil:"

msgid "This system's EFI partition: %s (disk %s, partition %s)"
msgstr "Deighilt EFI an chórais seo: %s (diosca %s, deighilt %s)"

msgid "This takes a while."
msgstr "Tógfaidh sé seo tamall."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "This version is from {when}."
msgstr "Tá an leagan seo ó {when}."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"This {title} file is for a different kind of computer. Download the version "
"for this one (often called {names})."
msgstr ""
"Tá an comhad {title} seo le haghaidh cineál eile ríomhaire. Íoslódáil an "
"leagan don cheann seo (ar a dtugtar {names} go minic)."

msgid ""
"Those are file sharing ports: folders are shared only on Home networks, in "
"Shared folders."
msgstr ""
"Is poirt chomhroinnte comhad iad sin: ní roinntear fillteáin ach ar líonraí "
"Baile, in Fillteáin chomhroinnte."

msgid "Thunderbolt or USB4 ports"
msgstr "Poirt Thunderbolt nó USB4"

msgid "Time server name"
msgstr "Ainm an fhreastalaí ama"

msgid "Time servers"
msgstr "Freastalaithe ama"

msgid ""
"Time servers to use instead of Fedora's. Type a name and click Add. Click a "
"server to take it off. Click Back when done."
msgstr ""
"Freastalaithe ama le húsáid in ionad chinn Fedora. Clóscríobh ainm agus "
"cliceáil Cuir leis. Cliceáil freastalaí chun é a bhaint. Cliceáil Siar nuair "
"a bheidh tú réidh."

msgid "Time zone"
msgstr "Crios ama"

