#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{name}: {steps}\n"
"\n"
"This really deletes these files from this computer: the user accounts and passwords (/etc/passwd, /etc/shadow, /etc/group, /etc/gshadow), the list of disks (/etc/fstab), the login rules (/etc/pam.d) and the administrator rules (/etc/sudoers). Your own files and apps aren't touched.\n"
"\n"
"Save your work and close your apps first: the computer restarts as soon as they're deleted.\n"
"\n"
"If putting them back doesn't work: when a start hangs or stays broken, hold the power button until the computer turns off, then turn it on. After 2 bad starts, the next start is the earlier version kept for Undo the last update, which has its own copy of these settings."
msgstr ""
"{name}: {steps}\n"
"\n"
"Scriosann sé seo na comhaid seo den ríomhaire seo i ndáiríre: na cuntais úsáideora agus na focail faire (/etc/passwd, /etc/shadow, /etc/group, /etc/gshadow), liosta na ndioscaí (/etc/fstab), na rialacha logála isteach (/etc/pam.d) agus na rialacha riarthóra (/etc/sudoers). Ní bhaintear le do chuid comhad agus aipeanna féin.\n"
"\n"
"Sábháil do chuid oibre agus dún d'aipeanna ar dtús: atosaíonn an ríomhaire a luaithe a scriostar iad.\n"
"\n"
"Mura n-oibríonn a gcur ar ais: nuair a théann tosú i bhfostú nó má fhanann sé briste, coinnigh an cnaipe cumhachta brúite go dtí go múchann an ríomhaire, ansin cas air é. Tar éis 2 dhrochthosú, is é an chéad tosú eile an leagan níos luaithe a choinnítear do Cealaigh an nuashonrú deireanach, a bhfuil a chóip féin de na socruithe seo aige."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{name}: {steps}\n"
"\n"
"When it comes back, a message says the test worked, and the test copy is removed. Don't turn the computer off during the test unless the steps say to. {save}\n"
"\n"
"The test copy takes the place of the earlier version kept for Undo the last update, so Undo has nothing to go back to until the next update."
msgstr ""
"{name}: {steps}\n"
"\n"
"Nuair a thagann sé ar ais, deir teachtaireacht gur oibrigh an tástáil, agus baintear an chóip thástála. Ná múch an ríomhaire le linn na tástála mura ndeir na céimeanna é. {save}\n"
"\n"
"Glacann an chóip thástála áit an leagain níos luaithe a choinnítear do Cealaigh an nuashonrú deireanach, mar sin níl aon rud ag Cealaigh le dul ar ais chuige go dtí an chéad nuashonrú eile."

